OL,3,GNEWSARescue dog wins prize for finding 
OL,4,Amissing person                         
OL,6,FA search and rescue dog has won a      
OL,7,Fnational prize for helping track down a
OL,8,Fmissing person in a remote area.       
OL,10,FCocker spaniel Olive and her Surrey    
OL,11,FSearch & Rescue handler Jonathan Cole  
OL,12,Fwere called to help police search for a
OL,13,Fvulnerable missing person in darkness  
OL,14,Fin July, according to Burns Bravery    
OL,15,FAwards organisers.                     
OL,17,FThe rescue dog directed Cole along a   
OL,18,Fwoodland path, where he was able to    
OL,19,Fspot the missing person by torchlight  
OL,20,Fand bring them to safety.              
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
